      "examineText": "Nossa Senhora da Anunciada, raised in 1521 by a captain who had promised it in a storm. The nave is four times a man's height and the bell can be heard at the kampung. Padre Tomas says the Jesuits keep it swept; he does not say who pays for the candles."
    },
